  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 2.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et non licebat eis aliquod forceapum facere burhmannis, et dare toll' suum et in sancto natali Domini duos grisengos pannos et unum brunum et decem libras piperis et cirotecas quinque hominum et duos caballinos tonellos aceto plenos; et totidem in pascha.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But they were not allowed any right of pre-emption over the burgesses, and [they had] to pay their toll, and at Christmas two lengths of grey cloth and one length of brown and 10 pounds of pepper and five pairs of gloves and two saddle-kegs of vinegar, and the same at Easter.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
